{"name":"Enjoy","hex":"#ead4c4","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"enjoy","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To receive pleasure or satisfaction from something.","To have the use or benefit of something."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/enjoy"}],"entries":[{"title":"Enjoy (2021 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Enjoy is a 2021 British short film directed by Saul Abraham. The film explores male mental health following a home tutor who is struggling to navigate his job and his depression. Enjoy was filmed in the United Kingdom and has been presented in a number of festivals, including the Raindance Film Festival, Aspen Shortsfest 2022 and Tribeca Film Festival where it premiered in 2021."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0d/Enjoy_Film_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enjoy_(2021_film)","wikidata":"Q114718332"},{"title":"Enjoy (2022 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Enjoy is a 2022 Indian Tamil-language romantic comedy film directed by Perumal Kasi, starring Madhankumar Dhakshinamoorthy, Vignesh and Harish Kumar. It was released on 23 December 2022."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/85/Enjoy_2022_poster.jpg/330px-Enjoy_2022_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enjoy_(2022_film)","wikidata":"Q116312048"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"enjoy":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/En-us-enjoy.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/84/En-us-enjoy.ogg/En-us-enjoy.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey heron (00129p)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Grey_heron_%2800129p%29.jpg/500px-Grey_heron_%2800129p%29.jpg","rati